OL,3,AViolence erupts in Bangladesh as ousted
OL,4,APM's supporters stage protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Bangladesh have fired tear
OL,7,Fgas and rubber bullets to disperse
OL,8,Fsupporters of the deposed Prime
OL,9,FMinister Sheikh Hasina, who are
OL,10,Fdemanding her return to the country.
OL,12,FA police vehicle was set on fire in
OL,13,FGopalganj district, where the banned
OL,14,Fstudent wing of Hasina's Awami League
OL,15,Fparty clashed with security forces.
OL,17,FNationwide protests by pro-Hasina
OL,18,Factivists started a day after the
OL,19,Fformer leader said she had requested a
OL,20,Fpassport to return to Bangladesh from
OL,21,Fexile in India.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
